# Runtime data and secrets. Run from server/ (setup.sh, README), the relative
# defaults put the SQLite DB, the Fernet integration key and cloud.env (the
# cloud device token, which is also the command-signing HMAC key) under data/.
# `COPY . .` must never bake them into an image layer
# (tests/test_dockerfile.py checks).
data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/.integration-key
**/cloud.env
